# #5837: the reachability latch exemption and the split transfer's link obligation.
MODULE: UnlinkedNeverClaimsExemptLeafArmsUnreachable
TARGET: UnlinkedNeverClaims
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an exempt, unlinked L arms: the arm does not require the view to read reachable
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE

--- FIND
LatchAdmitsClaim == ~WithLatch \/ moved \/ (eagerG /\ lat = "proven" /\ ~(birthAct /\ BoundPending))
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: any L not latched may claim.
LatchAdmitsClaim == ~WithLatch \/ moved \/ lat # "latched"
--- END
